    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Zendesk Workflow\n\n**Purpose**: n8n workflow: Zendesk Workflow. 7 nodes. Uses: zendesk, github, webhook. Sourced from czlonkowski/Zie619 n8n-workflows community archive (workflows/Zendesk/0279_Zendesk_GitHub_Create_Webhook.json). Configure credentials and any hardcoded IDs before activating.\n\n**Services needed**: zendesk, github, webhook\n\n**Difficulty**: 5min-config\n\n**Setup**:\n1. Configure credentials for the services above\n2. Update any hardcoded IDs / URLs\n3. Test with sample data before activating\n\n_Source: https://github.com/Zie619/n8n-workflows_\n_Curated by ai-ops-architect on 2026-05-05_",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 480
      },
      "name": "Setup Guide (delete after configuring)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -400,
        -400
      ],
      "id": "ai-ops-sticky-header"
    },
    {
      "id": "f0913aa6-4e78-4808-b828-7e9953e71764",
      "name": "Get ticket",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.zendesk",
      "position": [
        380,
        480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "id": "={{$node[\"On new Zendesk ticket\"].json[\"body\"][\"id\"]}}",
        "operation": "get"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "zendeskApi": {
          "id": "{{ $credentials.zendeskApi.id }}",
          "name": "[UPDATE ME]"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "notes": "This zendesk node performs automated tasks as part of the workflow."
    },
    {
      "id": "f8774217-bc05-4b02-8632-154654f79d5f",
      "name": "If Node",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        780,
        480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "string": [
            {
              "value1": "={{$node[\"Determine\"].json[\"GitHub Issue Number\"]}}",
              "operation": "isNotEmpty"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "notes": "This if node performs automated tasks as part of the workflow."
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae7e40b-b75c-41e2-9ba7-bb299f12911a",
      "name": "Update ticket",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.zendesk",
      "notes": "Update the Zendesk ticket by adding the Jira issue key to the \"Jira Issue Key\" field.",
      "position": [
        1180,
        580
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "id": "={{$node[\"On new Zendesk ticket\"].json[\"body\"][\"id\"]}}",
        "operation": "update",
        "updateFields": {
          "customFieldsUi": {
            "customFieldsValues": [
              {
                "id": 6721726848029,
                "value": "={{$node[\"Create issue\"].json[\"number\"]}}"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "zendeskApi": {
          "id": "{{ $credentials.zendeskApi.id }}",
          "name": "[UPDATE ME]"
        }
      },
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "7959986c-cfbf-4ba2-a968-95b62d2aa819",
      "name": "Determine",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.function",
      "notes": "if issue was created already in Jira",
      "position": [
        580,
        480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "functionCode": "/* configure here =========================================================== */\n/*  Zendesk field ID which represents the \"GitHub Issue Number\" field.\n*/\nconst ISSUE_KEY_FIELD_ID = 6721726848029;\n\n/* ========================================================================== */\nnew_items = [];\n\nfor (item of $items(\"Get ticket\")) {\n    \n    // instantiate a new variable for status\n    var custom_fields = item.json[\"custom_fields\"];\n    var github_issue_number = \"\";\n    for (var i = 0; i < custom_fields.length; i++) {\n        if (custom_fields[i].id == ISSUE_KEY_FIELD_ID) {\n            github_issue_number = custom_fields[i].value;\n            break;\n        }\n    }\n\n    // push the new item to the new_items array\n    new_items.push({\n        \"GitHub Issue Number\": github_issue_number\n    });\n}\n\nreturn new_items;"
      },
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
